  "release_date": "2024-01-23",
  "raw_notes": "Primal Ambush Sivir, Primal Ambush Riven, Primal Ambush Vi, Primal Ambush Talon, Three Honors Akshan, and Foreseen Yasuo will be available on January 24, 2024 at 20:00 UTC. Our newest champion Smolder, the Fiery Fledgling, (and his Heavenscale skin) will be heating up the Rift on January 31, 2024 at 20:00 UTC! E cooldown decreased. Base armor decreased. E damage decreased. Passive healing amplification decreased, bleed tick rate decreased. Q damage increased, damage type changed to magic, now applies on-hit effects and lifesteal. W heal on bite adjusted, critical strike modifier removed. Base health increased. Passive cooldown decreased. Q bonus movement speed increased. Q mana cost decreased, healing based on missing health increased. E passive armor penetration increased. Q damage increased. W damage increased. R damage increased. Q damage decreased. W damage decreased. W active duration adjusted. E damage increased. Armor and health growth increased. R cooldown decreased. Passive damage increased. E cooldown decreased. EQ flee duration now increases with rank. Base mana, mana growth, and health growth increased. Passive heal increased. E damage decreased. Base health increased. Q damage increased. E shield strength increased. Q damage increased. W magic resist reduction increased. Q damage increased. E magic resist reduction decreased. Base attack damage increased. E damage decreased. R charge time increased. Multiple adjustments to support more itemization options. Base health increased. The following skins will be released in this patch: The following chromas will be released this patch:",
